docs {
  # DocumentsService.GenerateRecordAct

  EBA closing (phase E7): the consolidated acta as a version for its signers and its PDF, the SIAGIE spreadsheet of the final grades of a section, and the certificates of enrollment, studies and conclusion of a cycle

